Statement of Purpose

The laws of most jurisdictions throughout the world automatically confer
exclusive Copyright and Related Rights upon the creator and subsequent
owner(s) of an original work of authorship and/or database.

Many people desire to contribute to the commons by dedicating all of
their Copyright and Related Rights to the public domain. Others want to
give everyone the right to use, modify, and share their work without
conditions.

This Creative Commons Public Domain Dedication (CC0) enables creators
to dedicate their works to the public domain, waiving all their Copyright
and Related Rights in the work worldwide to the extent allowed by law.

You should read the full legal text below, but here is the summary:

  You can copy, modify, distribute and perform the work, even for
  commercial purposes, all without asking permission.

Full Legal Text:

https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
